    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-sŭbĭdus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>stupid</i>, <i>foolish</i>
			(post-class.), <i><span class="en">Gell. 19, 9, 9</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vultus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Commod. 17, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scitamenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					18, 8, 1</span></i>
			.— <i>Comp.</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 6, 1,
				2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">13, 20,
			4</span></i>.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-sŭbĭdē</span></b> , <i>stupidly</i>, <i>foolishly</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid non insubide introspicere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 14, § 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">disserere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					1, 2, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
